From 762af17d113a1954e5b4959c8ac234d07c5a2360 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: road-trip-loop <loop@road-trip-game.local>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 11:13:04 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Motorhome, final shape (Class C after the reference): van
 cab with bonnet and raked glass, a 2.25 m box, a chamfered bunk over the cab;
 cream with brown and orange bands; dressing (boards, guard, front bumper kit,
 STOP sign) on dress: movers; guard and bonnet movers; entry door on the right
 hinged at its rear edge; cutaway takes the left side; room refitted; T3_RV
 eye and collision box moved

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

